GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Architecture> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Architecture> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Architecture> ;
    narr:childCount "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "7b130af84a13979746cd119703f7dbdb09965f98" ;
    narr:narration """The architecture of Meridian deployments has transitioned to a [mandatory signed-manifest gate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1), a structural control designed to prevent the unauthorized artifact exposure observed in previous quarters. This shift is framed as a [definitive gate decision](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) that formalizes the requirement for a signed release manifest prior to any deployment. The scope of this control [extends to both staging and production environments](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4), establishing a consistent technical barrier across the pipeline. While the [rationale is rooted in a specific past failure](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), the current implementation functions as a broad, ongoing architectural requirement [owned by Quinton Fairweather](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5). The overall trajectory reflects a move toward [hardened artifact verification](narr:Narrative_SignedReleaseManifestGating), prioritizing conservation and system competence over previous, more permissive deployment patterns.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SignedReleaseManifestGating> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The gate is justified by a specific past incident, potentially limiting its scope to the conditions of that failure." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "Direct and punchy, favoring concise, formal declarations of authority." ; narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "Decisive and firm, presenting rules as established facts." ; narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:writer "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite" .
